OL,3,GNEWSACouncil shake-up plans face
OL,4,Afurther delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace the seven councils in
OL,7,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough with
OL,8,Feither two or three new authorities are
OL,9,Ffacing a further delay.
OL,11,FThe new councils would oversee services
OL,12,Fincluding planning and social care.
OL,13,FFive options were put forward for
OL,14,Fconsideration, with elections to any
OL,15,Fnew unitary authorities scheduled for
OL,16,FMay 2028.
OL,18,FJim McMahon MP, minister for local
OL,19,Fgovernment, devolution and regional
OL,20,Fgrowth, told the House of Commons on
OL,21,FThursday proposals submitted for the
OL,22,Farea "will remain under consideration".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
